Tiers import downwards only: `app → surfaces → domains → capabilities → foundation`
(enforced by `eslint-plugin-boundaries`). API types come from the generated
`foundation/api/schema.d.ts` (`npm run api:types`). UI rules: **`frontend/UI-CONVENTIONS.md`**.
Run `npm run ci` before calling work done.
